1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,100
This plasma jet is fifteen times wider than our entire Milky Way galaxy.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:09,640
It blasts out one point five million light years into absolute nothingness.

3
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:14,180
At the center of galaxy Hercules A sits a supermassive black hole.

4
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:17,540
It weighs four billion times more than our own sun.

5
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:22,570
Pause now and guess how much energy this monster generates every second.

6
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:26,260
It pumps out more power than a trillion stars combined.

7
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:30,260
Magnetic fields accelerate plasma to nearly the speed of light.

8
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:34,800
This jet is actively choking its own galaxy from forming new stars.

9
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:38,280
It pushes star material out into intergalactic space forever.

10
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:39,760
And that is why...
